up>&#x02212;</sup>, NH<sub>3</sub>, and nitrous acid in homes with and without kerosene space heaters</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>107</volume><fpage>223</fpage><lpage>231</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10064553</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11-ehp0116-000631"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sheppard</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Checkoway</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kaufman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lumley</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Koenig</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>A case-crossover analysis of particulate matter air pollution and out-of-hospital primary cardiac arrest</article-title><source>Epidemiology</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>193</fpage><lpage>199</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11246580</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b12-ehp0116-000631"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liao</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Creason</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Shy</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Watts</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Zweidinger</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><article-title>Daily variation of particulate air pollution and poor cardiac autonomic control in the elderly</article-title><source>Environ Health Perspect</source><volume>107</volume><fpage>521</fpage><lpage>525</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10378998</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b13-ehp0116-000631"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-grou